    tasks: [
      'Confirm the movement and its direction: which host reached which asset, over what protocol, with which account (CISA: how is the lateral movement conducted?)',
      'Establish whether the account/key is authorised to reach this asset from this source at all — an allowlisted admin path is expected; anything else is the finding',
      'Reconstruct what happened on the SOURCE host immediately before the login — the prior high-severity alert is the entry point, not the login',
      'Enumerate what the session did after authenticating: commands run, files read (detection config, secrets), new accounts or persistence created',
      'Scope the blast radius: search every other high-value asset for a successful login from any host carrying a recent high-severity alert',
