    ],
    containment: 'Isolate the SOURCE host (the pivot/origin), not just the target — the target login is the symptom. Rotate the abused credential and kill active sessions. Do NOT auto-block the management-plane asset itself: on infrastructure, contain by credential and by isolating the origin, and escalate for authorised action.',
  },
  'Initial Access': {
    focus: 'The earliest point the chain can be broken — but the signature proves an attempt, not a compromise. The first question is whether it succeeded.',
